{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_08",
  "title": "渗透作战",
  "storyCode": "OD-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "885b107b1934fa4291273b75ee797873e5828a80822644eb8afd40ed2a80994e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "巡林者的地图只画到这里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "接下来就只能靠我们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这个洞穴......没想到这么大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这么来看，整个镇子的地下都是空的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "爆炸物没问题吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......安全屋里威力最大的那一批都在这里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "希望Lord的计划有效。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "恐怕没有那么简单，看那边......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "......希望不是我想的那种......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畸变体感染者",
      "text": "嘎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这是......人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "畸变体感染者",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "不管它是什么，它会死，就够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "现在不管出现什么鬼东西我都不会觉得奇怪了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "不要缠斗，尽量突破，我们没有时间浪费在这里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......为什么长泉的地下会有一个这样的设施？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "科恩......这里是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "我就知道！我*粗口*就知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "原来大部分实验室都被传送到这里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "现在想想，都是我们太大意了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "在这个镇子上生活了这么久，竟然毫无察觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这件事情的背后，就是那个疯子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这是什么味道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "还能是什么，死亡的味道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "保持警惕，跟紧点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这都是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "笼子？这么多笼子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "全都是尸体......人和动物混在一起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "这都是列维•克里奇科的杰作，此人的疯狂和残忍超乎常人想象。怪我当初还想过活捉，就应该一枪打穿他的脑门。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "一般的疯子还做不到这么恐怖的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......笼子里有个活人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "看看谁来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "是那个德鲁奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "这混账东西就是烧成灰我也认得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "啊，是你们，是那群雇佣兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "很高兴看到你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我知道我们之前有过很多矛盾......但是这些矛盾都可以搁置一边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我猜你们要找那个学者......我知道他在哪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我们现在有一个共同的敌人，在这件事上我们应该能够合作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "这人的脸皮厚得让我感到恶心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "那边那个菲林，我知道你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你的身手还是很好认的，哥伦比亚的雇佣兵市场上能打听到很多消息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你是个杀手，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "罗德岛愿意雇佣你，说明即便是罗德岛也有很多脏活要做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "比起其他人，你一定更懂得权衡利弊，我们来谈谈吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......闭嘴，或者我让你闭嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "真是遗憾，我以为像你这样的人会更加务实。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "把笼子打开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "什么......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "没事，把笼子打开就行了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "这就对了，大家都是明白人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "是，我当然是个明白人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "等等，你要做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "啊！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你！你疯了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "救命......救......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "救......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "别......别打了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "呵，你还能说话，说明打得还不够。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "这一拳，是为了米亚罗医生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "好了好了，别打了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "你下手也太狠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "怎么......你还同情他?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "好家伙，你都快把他打死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "脸都打变形了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "省点力气吧，我们还有事要干。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "你说得对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......噗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "没什么，只是感觉心情舒畅了很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "没错，我也舒畅多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这家伙被关在这里，看起来也是被列维算计了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "我一点都不觉得惊讶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......没看到有人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......谨慎一点，可能会有埋伏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "瞧瞧是谁来了，我的实验宝地又有访客了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "许久不见，彩虹小队的朋友们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "你们来得正是时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "不......你们每次来得都正是时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "不要费劲了，这面玻璃是防弹的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "我对你的果断表示赞许，板机扣得毫不犹豫，不等人体面地结束开场白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "但让我们回到这场戏来吧，美好的开场需要优秀的观众，美好的开场也需要完整的开幕致辞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "今天是赞颂造物主伟业的日子，而这个造物主，就是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "造物主？你还真敢给自己的脸上贴金。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "你这个丧心病狂的疯子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "疯子......呵。庸人最喜欢用这个词来形容他们不能理解的思维和想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "看看这个世界，看看这个世界！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "截然不同的化学性质......完全颠覆的物理法则......科学之花要在探索和怀疑中绽放，这个充满未知的大地就是最好的土壤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "而现在，我成功了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "你们看到了吗？你们感到了吗？就在那乍看极为类似的表象之下，万事万物运作的原理全然不同！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "这是生命的进化，这是存在的迭代。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "源石就是这个世界的真理，你们应当接纳它，而不是恐惧它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "欢迎来到未来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "你对自己的所作所为就没有一丝道德上的抵触吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "人命在你看来究竟是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "人性本质软弱，善恶是软弱前提下的主观定义，老生常谈的愧疚感则不过是我们大脑产生的无数种认知信号之一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "而我所追求的科学，从来不会被这种软弱与模糊的概念所左右。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "不要自欺欺人了，即便是在这个世界，你依然尝试用你那种毫无意义的概念来束缚自己的思维。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "即便是电子信息技术，核能源......这些技术最初的来源都是为了彼此更高效地互相杀戮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "难道你还想给科学添加一层新的定义？让一切都符合你稚嫩的精神需求？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "愚昧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "但是我原谅你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "你们可以不明白，我允许你们不明白。思维滞后是一种普遍存在的愚昧，这不是你们的错，我原谅你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "我的致辞结束了，除了原谅，我还要感谢诸位的耐心等待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "现在，赞美吧——赞美这种全新的生命形态。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "赞美——赞美——赞美！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "无论付出什么代价，绝不能让这个东西到地面上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "你们拖住它！我安装炸弹！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
